[I] Remote Desktop Awareness Shared Library

[T] librda is a Remote Desktop Awareness library from the Arctica Project.
[T] It lets applications detect whether they run inside a remote desktop
[T] session, such as X2Go or NX, and query information about it to adapt
[T] their behavior.

[U] https://github.com/ArcticaProject/librda

[A] librad developers
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

[C] extra/tool
[F] CROSS

